# Personal editor settings and machine-specific build artifacts.
.vscode/
*-debug.spec
# _diag.py and afdiag*.spec are build inputs (the specs compile _diag.py), so
# they are versioned rather than ignored — an ignored entry point makes the
# diagnostic build irreproducible on a fresh checkout.

# Screenshots taken on a real machine: file paths, user names and index
# statistics in them are personal, so they stay out of the source tree.
docs/ui-*.png
docs/shot-*.png

# Rust build output and editor/tool caches.
